---
// El ecosistema #NoTanMal: Libro, Tienda y Universo
---

<section class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Título de sección -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-brand-yellow/20 text-black text-sm font-semibold rounded-full mb-4 border border-brand-yellow/40">
        El ecosistema
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4">
        Tres pilares para sobrevivir
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Contenido, productos y comunidad. Todo con el mismo espíritu: honestidad, humor y cero humo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid de 3 pilares -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- El libro -->
      <article class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 border-2 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] hover:shadow-[5px_5px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.9)] hover:translate-x-[-2px] hover:translate-y-[-2px] transition-all duration-300">
        <!-- Icono emoji -->
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-brand-yellow rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-2 border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] text-5xl">
          📖
        </div>

        <!-- Badge -->
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-brand-yellow text-black text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] uppercase tracking-wide">
            Próximamente
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Contenido -->
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-4 text-center">El libro</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Un manual de supervivencia mental para gente que vive en un mundo que no pidió.
          Sin autoayuda, sin promesas vacías. Solo humor y perspectiva.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <a
          href="/libro"
          class="group/link inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-black text-black font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:translate-x-[-1px] hover:translate-y-[-1px] transition-all"
        >
          Saber más
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- La tienda -->
      <article class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 border-2 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.9)] hover:shadow-[5px_5px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.9)] hover:translate-x-[-2px] hover:translate-y-[-2px] transition-all duration-300">
        <!-- Icono emoji -->
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-brand-yellow rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-2 border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] text-5xl">
          👕
        </div>

        <!-- Badge -->
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-green-500 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] uppercase tracking-wide">
            🔥 Disponible ya
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Contenido -->
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-4 text-center">La tienda</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Camisetas, tazas, láminas y más. Productos honestos con mensajes que dicen
          lo que piensas pero no te atreves a gritar en la oficina.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <a
          href="/tienda"
          class="group/link inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-4 py-2.5 bg-black text-white border border-black font-bold rounded-lg shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.8)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.8)] hover:translate-x-[-1px] hover:translate-y-[-1px] transition-all"
        >
          Ver productos
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- El universo -->
      <article class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 border-2 border-black shadow-[4px_4px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] hover:shadow-[5px_5px_0_rgba(250,204,21,0.9)] hover:translate-x-[-2px] hover:translate-y-[-2px] transition-all duration-300">
        <!-- Icono emoji -->
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-brand-yellow rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border-2 border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] text-5xl">
          🌍
        </div>

        <!-- Badge -->
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-black shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] uppercase tracking-wide">
            Descubre más
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Contenido -->
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-text-main mb-4 text-center">El universo</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Descubre quiénes somos, qué hacemos y por qué lo hacemos. Spoiler: no somos
          gurús ni vendemos humo.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <a
          href="/universo"
          class="group/link inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-black text-black font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-[2px_2px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:shadow-[3px_3px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:translate-x-[-1px] hover:translate-y-[-1px] transition-all"
        >
          Explorar
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1 group-hover/link:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
